    "name": "Symphone",
    "steam_appid": 3379210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Symphone</i> is a platformer set in a once-vibrant world now consumed by a mysterious force known as &quot;The Silence.&quot; This dark power steals the voices of the creatures of Symphone, turning them into lost souls wandering aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Euphony, a unique bunny without a voice, on a quest to collect these souls and restore the music and light that once filled the forest. Journey through a desolate, bioluminescent world, overcoming obstacles, and dodging threats to free the souls trapped by &quot;The Silence.&quot; Each soul you collect brings Euphony closer to completing the final symphony, a powerful melody capable of banishing the darkness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming Action</strong> \u2013 Jump, dodge, and explore a beautiful yet haunting forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story</strong> \u2013 Experience a touching narrative about loss, restoration, and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that follows you throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bioluminescent World</strong> \u2013 Stunning visual style with glowing environments that come to life as you restore balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face environmental challenges and enemies in your journey to save the world from The Silence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Euphony restore harmony to Symphone and bring light back to her world. Will you be the one to end The Silence?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/de90dc9cb6407141fbdc4befbab9a90f.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Symphone</i> is a platformer set in a once-vibrant world now consumed by a mysterious force known as &quot;The Silence.&quot; This dark power steals the voices of the creatures of Symphone, turning them into lost souls wandering aimlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/4fdecb03a3dc9359a2143d65bbe92e9e.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Euphony, a unique bunny without a voice, on a quest to collect these souls and restore the music and light that once filled the forest. Journey through a desolate, bioluminescent world, overcoming obstacles, and dodging threats to free the souls trapped by &quot;The Silence.&quot; Each soul you collect brings Euphony closer to completing the final symphony, a powerful melody capable of banishing the darkness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379210/extras/72d87be09184a7391513f3b7a273f900.avif?t=1734651390\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming Action</strong> \u2013 Jump, dodge, and explore a beautiful yet haunting forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Story</strong> \u2013 Experience a touching narrative about loss, restoration, and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a captivating soundtrack that follows you throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bioluminescent World</strong> \u2013 Stunning visual style with glowing environments that come to life as you restore balance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles</strong> \u2013 Face environmental challenges and enemies in your journey to save the world from The Silence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Euphony restore harmony to Symphone and bring light back to her world. Will you be the one to end The Silence?</p>",
